<title>USA: ATC offers no reason for stock decline.</title>
<headline>ATC offers no reason for stock decline.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>ATC Communications Group Inc said it did not know why its share price dropped to a 52-week low in Nasdaq trading on Monday.</p>
<p>The stock fell 17/32 to 5-7/16.</p>
<p>&quot;There has been no change in the fundamentals of our business since we reported second-quarter results to our investors on February 6,&quot; said Arthur Chavoya, the company's president and chief executive.</p>
<p>ATC provides outsourced call-center and telemarketing services for major corporations.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
